* [[佐久市長|Mayor of Saku City]], [[:ja:柳田清二|Seiji Yanagida]], spoke about the anime film " [[Your Name|Your Name."]] Since it has been introduced as a sacred place for the movie, some people visit the area to verify the location or make a pilgrimage there. <ref>[https://twitter.com/Seiji_Ya/status/771939265534132224 【君の名は。『聖地』新海三社神社】]佐久市長柳田清二Twitter, 2016.9.3</ref>

