There is a {{ill|Shinboku|There is a sacred|en|12=draft|12=draft}} {{ill|10=ja|11=スギ|Cryptomeria|en|12=draft|12=draft}} tree about 20 meters in front of the east main hall. Its age is unknown, but as of 1940 it was over 30 metres tall, 12 metres thick at the base, and 8 metres at its diameter. <ref name="nagano">[https://dl.ndl.go.jp/info:ndljp/pid/1115449/57 県社新海三社神社御神木杉]『[長野県]史蹟名勝天然紀念物調査報告. 第21輯』長野県、1940</ref> When {{ill|10=ja|11=金剛力士|Nio (Buddhism)|lt=the Niomon Gate|en|4=fr|5=Niō|12=draft|12=draft}} burned down in the early Meiji period, the fire spread to the base of the temple, and all {{ill|Ujigami|the parishioners|en|12=draft|12=draft}} gathered together and spent several days extinguishing the fire. Before the war, when the trunk of the tree began to lean severely, they received guidance from Dr. {{ill|10=ja|11=本多静六|Honda Seiroku|en|12=draft|12=draft}}, a doctor of {{ill|10=ja|11=博士（林学）|forestry|en|12=draft|12=draft}} and had it reinforced with donations from all the parishioners. <ref name="nagano" />

== Anecdote ==

* The road taken during the divine procession was called "Shinkaido" and {{ill|Shinko-shiki|the divine procession|en|12=draft|12=draft}} itself was called " {{ill|10=ja|11=御幸|Miyuki|en|12=draft|12=draft}} " <ref>『限定復刻版 佐久口碑伝説集 北佐久篇』7ページ。</ref> .
* Behind the shrine is Yoshiike Pond. Long ago, a monk learned of this pond after hearing a prophecy from a snake. It is said that when a monk ground ink in the water of the pond and wrote Sanskrit characters, the characters were reflected on 36 sheets of paper below, and so the Goshintomi Festival began. It was also said that anyone who saw a Shinto priest wearing a white mask going to fetch water in the middle of the night would suffer misfortune, so villagers would go to bed early. <ref>『限定復刻版 佐久口碑伝説集 南佐久篇』121ページ。</ref>
* {{ill|10=ja|11=佐久市長|Mayor of Saku City|en|12=draft|12=draft}}, {{ill|10=ja|11=柳田清二|Seiji Yanagida|en|12=draft|12=draft}}, spoke about the anime film " {{ill|Your Name|Your Name."|en|12=draft|12=draft}} Since it has been introduced as a sacred place for the movie, some people visit the area to verify the location or make a pilgrimage there. <ref>[https://twitter.com/Seiji_Ya/status/771939265534132224 【君の名は。『聖地』新海三社神社】]佐久市長柳田清二Twitter, 2016.9.3</ref>

