{{ill|Shinkai Sansha Shrine|ja|新海三社神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shinkai Sansha Shrine|qq=}} is a regional {{ill|Sōja shrine|Sōja shrine|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sōja shrine|qq=}}.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Shinkaisansya-jinja Shrine|url=https://www.guidoor.jp/en/places/3414|access-date=2023-11-01|website=Guidoor|language=en}}</ref> in {{ill|Minamisaku District, Nagano|en|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Minamisaku District, Nagano|qq=}} {{ill|Kitasaku District, Nagano|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kitasaku District, Nagano|qq=}} {{ill|Chiisagata District, Nagano|en|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Chiisagata District, Nagano|qq=}} It enshrines many kami of the local region.

It contrasts with provincial Soja shrines which enshrine all the kami of a province<ref>https://archive.ph/wip/XtZfZ</ref>

'''Shinkai Sansha Shrine''' (also simply called " '''Shinkai Shrine''' ") is {{ill|Shinto shrine|a shrine|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shinto shrine|qq=}} located in {{ill|10=ja|11=田口村_(長野県)|Taguchi|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/10=ja|qq=}}, {{ill|10=ja|11=佐久市|Saku, Nagano|en|4=fr|5=Saku (Japon)|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/10=ja|qq=}}. It was a former prefectural shrine and {{ill|Sōja shrine|the main shrine|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sōja shrine|qq=}} of {{ill|10=ja|11=佐久郡|Saku District, Shinano|lt=Saku District|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/10=ja|qq=}} . The {{ill|10=ja|11=deity|enshrined deities|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/10=ja|qq=}} are {{ill|10=ja|11=意岐萩命|Okihagi no Mikoto|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/10=ja|qq=}}, {{ill|10=ja|11=タケミナカタ|Takeminakata|lt=Takeminakata no Mikoto|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/10=ja|qq=}}, {{ill|Kotoshironushi|lt=Kotoshironushi no Mikoto|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kotoshironushi|qq=}}, and {{ill|Emperor Ōjin|lt=Homudawake no Mikoto|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Emperor Ōjin|qq=}} . {{ill|10=ja|11=家紋|Mon (emblem)|lt=The sacred crest|en|4=fr|5=Mon (héraldique)|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/10=ja|qq=}} is {{ill|10=ja|11=梶葉|the Kaji leaf|en|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/10=ja|qq=}} . The founding date is unknown.

